  "description": "What better way to honor their love of the outdoors than with an authentic, camouflaged set of wheels? Your little adventure-seekers will stylishly blend in with nature on the Mossy Oak 20-inch BMX Bike by Dynacraft. Decked out in Mossy Oak’s signature camouflage paint finish, this bike is an exciting way for your child to get around the neighborhood. The BMX-style steel frame is light and versatile, and the front and rear foot pegs let them try out new moves. In true BMX fashion, front hand brakes and a rear V brake give the rider complete control over stopping while the freestyle rotor allows a wide range of motion. The Mossy Oak 20-inch BMX bike is perfect for rides with friends, camping trips, and conquering new terrain in the great outdoors.",
